          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On January 6, 2009, at 8:00 PM, while at home, a witness observed in the sky the rapid movement of two round, yellow-orange objects heading towards Cambrai. The witness reported his observation by phone to GEIPAN; he refused to go to the gendarmerie. Due to the brief information given by the witness, no hypothesis can be considered. This case is classified in category C: lack of information.",
